.TH "gtk4-widget-factory" "1" "" "GTK" "GTK commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gtk4-widget-factory \- Showcase GTK widgets and styles
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBgtk4\-widget\-factory\fP [OPTIONS...]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBgtk4\-widget\-factory\fP is a collection of examples.
.sp
Its purpose is to demonstrate many GTK widgets in a form that is useful to GTK theme developers.
.sp
The application shows widgets in different, typical combinations and states.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
